    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5120" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμειψις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμείβω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exchange, interchange,</i>
